OL,10,D]MG A New Master BBC Microcomputer
OL,12,W,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,13,D]
OL,14,D]FOn Monday 1st September, BBC & Acorn
OL,15,D]Flaunched a new BBC micro in the
OL,16,D]FMaster range - the "Master Compact".
OL,17,D]
OL,18,D]FThis is an addition to the existing
OL,19,D]F"Master" range of microcomputers.
OL,20,D]F
OL,21,D]FIt is based on the Master 128, but
OL,22,T]Fis at a much lower price.
OL,23,D]F                   A]CFrom 06-09-86
OL,24,ANext PageBT'text FilesCRewindFReg Radio
FL,1fc,180,120,250,0,100
