SC,0002
CT,8,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F185A1788705231
OL,1,Q] Spp`p0pp`pp`p0ppQ|^T\|||||||||||G2/6
OL,2,Q] Sfj= .j5j=1j5   D]  A]CEducation
OL,3,Q] S#""#!# "##"!!"!   D]  A] CReviews
OL,4, T|||||||||||||||||||~|||||||||||
OL,5,A]CMThe Master Compact computer D]
OL,7, T||||||||||||||||||||||||||||||]
OL,8, T]FThis new micro uses the Master 128
OL,9, T]Ftechnology. It is supplied as a
OL,10, T]Fcomplete 'ready-to-use' package
OL,11, T]Fincluding disc drive, monitor,
OL,12, T]Fcomputer, and 'Welcome' software.
OL,13, D]F
OL,14, D]FIt can use any existing Master 128
OL,15, D]Fsoftware supplied on 3\ inch disc
OL,16, D]Fformat. This range already includes
OL,17, D]Fseveral hundred titles from leading
OL,18, D]Fsoftware houses.
OL,19, D]F
OL,20, D]FExtensive 'welcome' software is
OL,21, D]Fsupplied - 430K of programs in
OL,22, D]Ftotal!
OL,23, D]F                  A]CFrom 06-09-86
OL,24,ANext PageBT'text FilesCRewindFReg Radio
