OL,1,Q] Spp`p0pp`pp`p0ppQ|^T\|||||||||||G4/6
OL,2,Q] Sfj= .j5j=1j5   D]  A]CEducation
OL,3,Q] S#""#!# "##"!!"!   D]  A] CReviews
OL,4, T|||||||||||||||||||~|||||||||||
OL,5,A]CMThe Master Compact computer D]
OL,7, T||||||||||||||||||||||||||||||]
OL,8, T]FThe low price of the Compact range
OL,9, T]Fis achieved by cutteng down on the
OL,10, T]Flittle used features of the Master
OL,11, T]Fcomputer.
OL,12, T]F
OL,13, D]FThe number of sockets have been
OL,14, D]Freduced. The 'Tube', 1mhz Bus,
OL,15, D]FUser Port, Cassette interface,
OL,16, D]Fand A-to-D convertor have all been
OL,17, D]Fsacrificed.
OL,18, D]F
OL,19, D]FThere is, however, a printer socket,
OL,20, D]Fand a connector for a 'Mouse'.
OL,21, D]F
OL,22, D]F'Atari' style joysticks will plug
OL,23, D]Fin to the 'mouse' socket.
OL,24,ANext PageBT'text FilesCRewindFReg Radio
FL,1fc,180,120,250,0,100
