OL,1,Q] Spp`p0pp`pp`p0ppQ|^T\|||||||||||G5/6
OL,2,Q] Sfj= .j5j=1j5   D]  A]CEducation
OL,3,Q] S#""#!# "##"!!"!   D]  A] CReviews
OL,4, T|||||||||||||||||||~|||||||||||
OL,5,A]CMThe Master Compact computer D]
OL,7, T||||||||||||||||||||||||||||||]
OL,8, T]FUpgrades available for the Master
OL,9, T]FCompact computer include:
OL,10, T]F
OL,11, T]C*FEconet interface. To connect to
OL,12, T]F  any Econet system.
OL,13, D]F  Price:Caround #50
OL,14, D]F
OL,15, D]C*FRS232 port. Allows connection of
OL,16, D]F  Modems and other standard items.
OL,17, D]F  Price:C#29.90 inc VAT
OL,18, D]F
OL,19, D]C*FAdditional disc drive (3\" only).
OL,20, D]F  Other types of drive cannot be
OL,21, D]F  connected without modification.
OL,22, D]F  Price:C#113.85 inc VAT
OL,23, D]                   A]CFrom 06-09-86
