OL,4, T|||||||||||||||||||~|||||||||||
OL,5,A]CMThe Master Compact computer D]
OL,7, T||||||||||||||||||||||||||||||]
OL,8, D]FAlthough a part of the BBC Master
OL,9, T]Fseries, the Compact computer is not
OL,10, T]Fexpandable to the full capabilities
OL,11, T]Fof the Master 128.
OL,12, T]C
OL,13, D]FMany items, such as the Teletext
OL,14, D]Fadapter, 5{ inch disc drives,
OL,15, D]Fcassette recorder, second processors
OL,16, D]Fand even a normal TV set cannot be
OL,17, D]Fdirectly connected.
OL,18, D]F
OL,19, D]FA full review of the BBC Master
OL,20, D]FCompact will appear onCREPORTF
OL,21, D]Fshortly.
OL,22, D]F
OL,23,A]CFrom 06-09-86   teletextarchive.com
